A compact relationship model is $\begin{aligned}
\text{attention to another person}
&+ \text{useful free value} \\
&\longrightarrow \text{memory and trust} \\
&\longrightarrow \text{future referral}.
\end{aligned}$ This is why the speaker calls networking a matter of planting seeds. The commercial effect is delayed, but the relationship path has been opened.

